# 4-to-16 decoder: a Dec2 on A3 A2 enables one of four Dec2 on A1 A0.
chip Dec4
    in A: 4, EN
    out Y0, Y1, Y2, Y3, Y4, Y5, Y6, Y7, Y8, Y9, Y10, Y11, Y12, Y13, Y14, Y15

    g0, g1, g2, g3 = Dec2(A[2], A[3], EN)
    Y0, Y1, Y2, Y3 = Dec2(A[0], A[1], g0)
    Y4, Y5, Y6, Y7 = Dec2(A[0], A[1], g1)
    Y8, Y9, Y10, Y11 = Dec2(A[0], A[1], g2)
    Y12, Y13, Y14, Y15 = Dec2(A[0], A[1], g3)
